        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage KS23F2300 Kryptonite Padlock with 5/16\" Diameter Shackle & 2\" Clearance</b>\r\n<p>\r\nAll Schlage commercial <a href=\"/collections/padlock-accessories-padlocks\"><b>padlocks</b></a> meet or exceed ASTM standards for standard steel shackle, shackle cutting and corrosion resistance.  The 5/16\" shackle with 2\" clearance is made of hardened alloy steel with a double deadbolt locking mechanism for maximum security.  The lock body is made from solid brass to resist corrosion with a satin brass finish.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/schlage-kryptonite-padlock-with-5-16-diameter-shackle\"><b>Schlage KS23D2300 1-1/2\" Clearance Brass Padlock</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Schlage Kryptonite padlock uses a solid brass standard Schlage C keyway lock cylinder, 6 pin, keyed to 5 pins. Each lock code includes 2 silver nickel keys.  Because this padlock uses a standard Schlage C keyway, it can also use the same key as your other Schlage locks that are on your home or business. \r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> for Schlage KS23F2300 Padlock\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Shackle Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Height: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Width: 1-25/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Depth: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\" (51mm)</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\" 6 Pin Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys per Lock Code</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIf ordering multiple locks you can have them Key Alike (use the same key) or Keyed Different (different keys for each lock).  \r\n</p>",
