                "title": "Schlage Kryptonite Padlock with 5/16 Diameter Shackle, 2 Inch Clearance",
                "description": "Schlage KS23F2300 - All Schlage commercial padlocks meet or exceed ASTM standards for standard steel shackle, shackle cutting and corrosion resistance.  The 5/16 inch shackle is made of hardened alloy steel with a double deadbolt locking mechanism for maximum security.  The lock body is made from solid brass to resist corrosion with a satin brass finish.",
